ord here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September ran 49% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October ran 54%. In 2026, May to June came in at 216% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 12163 had its driest year in 1962 at 56%.</p>"}
